{"record_type":"func","qualified_name":"github.com/livekit/livekit-server/pkg/config.NewConfig","decl":"func NewConfig(confString string, strictMode bool, c *cli.Command, baseFlags []cli.Flag) (*Config, error)","span":{"start_line":463,"end_line":539},"summary":"Builds a Config by cloning defaults, applying YAML and CLI overrides, validating RTC settings, expanding paths, applying legacy defaults, and copying legacy limits.","summary_step":["1. Marshals and unmarshals DefaultConfig to start with a deep default copy.","2. If a YAML config string is provided, decodes it into the config with known-field validation controlled by strictMode.","3. If a CLI command is provided, applies generated and legacy CLI overrides.","4. Validates RTC configuration using the development-mode setting.","5. Expands environment variables and home directory in KeyFile.","6. Applies default TURN relay port ranges for development or production when not configured.","7. Applies deprecated LogLevel and PionLevel settings into Logging configuration.","8. Copies deprecated room limits into LimitConfig when legacy fields are set and returns the config."]}
